Package: com.551.obdelevenupdatebypass
Name: OBDeleven Update Bypass
Version: 1.0.2
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Bypasses the forced Update Required gate in regular OBDeleven 1.11.0 by forcing the launch usability state to ready and blocking ForceUpdateViewController as a failsafe.
